# Keep the Docker build context small and stable. The easybuggy image only
# needs pom.xml, src/, catalina.policy and init.sql (see Dockerfile), so
# exclude everything heavy or irrelevant: --build then sends far less to the
# daemon and unrelated file changes no longer invalidate the build cache.
.git
.gitignore
target
logs
*.log
# These services build from their own contexts, not this one:
attacker-app
keycloak
ollama
# Docs, local env, runtime data and editor files:
*.md
.env
data
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
